# Converts distances from kilometres to miles.
# expect "convert 42.195 to miles" is convert 42.195 into miles
to convert (km) into miles:
    give back km * 0.621371
for each km in [5, 10, 21.1, 42.2]:
    show km, "km is", convert km into miles rounded to 1 decimal, "miles"
show "A marathon is", convert 42.195 to miles rounded to 2 decimals
